  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Observation and monitoring of elections</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support efforts to increase civic scrutiny, transparency and accountability in both municipal and general elections. This work will include:
a.	Monitoring of electoral processes: media monitoring; and regular engagement with electoral authorities at all levels to discuss implementation of electoral rules and regulations. 
b.	Nationwide observation: national observers will be deployed across the country to ensure the integrity of electoral activities. For the general and provincial elections, observers will be supported to observe all stages of the electoral cycle, from voter registration to post-election day &#x2013; and potentially to carry out provincial parallel vote tabulation (PVT) exercises.</narrative>
  </description>
